{"title": "Legendary Action: Wretched Growth (Condition)", "pageid": 35454, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Wretched_Growth_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Conditions", "Dexterity saving throws"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/28px-Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/42px-Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/56px-Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action Wretched Growth Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/28px-Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Legendary Action: Wretched Growth</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>If a creature ends its turn within 5 m (17 ft) of the Shambling Mound, it will take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">3d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> and Shadow-Cursed Vines will grow at its feet, possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entangling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\">Entangling</a> it. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SCL_SHAMBLINGMOUND_ENTANGLE_AURA</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSCL_SHAMBLINGMOUND_ENTANGLE_AURA%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSCL_SHAMBLINGMOUND_ENTANGLE_AURA%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Wretched_Growth\">Condition: Wretched Growth</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wretched_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Wretched Growth (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/28px-Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/42px-Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/56px-Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wretched Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/28px-Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Wretched_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wretched_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Wretched Growth (Condition)\">Wretched Growth</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (DC&nbsp;16)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;16)</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;5 m (17 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;5 m (17 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity will take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">3d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> and possibly become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entangled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\">Entangled</a> by Shadow-Cursed Vines if it ends its turn within 5 m (17 ft) of the Shambling Mound.</li>\n<li>On save, the affected entity still takes half damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Not to be confused with the condition it inflicts on the victim: <a href=\"/wiki/Wretched_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Wretched Growth (Condition)\">Wretched Growth (Condition)</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Legendary_Action:_Wretched_Growth\">Sources of Legendary Action: Wretched Growth</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Wretched_Growth\" title=\"Legendary Action: Wretched Growth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Wretched Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Legendary_Action_Wretched_Growth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Im